WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:04.013
RUSSIAN FOREIGN MINISTER SAID

00:00:02.145 --> 00:00:05.415
HIS COUNTRY MIGHT HELP IN THE

00:00:04.147 --> 00:00:06.950
INVESTIGATION.

00:00:05.548 --> 00:00:10.553
RUSSIA DENIED INVOLVEMENT.

00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:12.455
THESE ARE THE MOST DESPERATE

00:00:10.687 --> 00:00:14.557
TIMES IN VENEZUELA.

00:00:12.589 --> 00:00:16.659
THE ECONOMY IS COLLAPSING.

00:00:14.691 --> 00:00:20.230
POVERTY IS SKY ROCKETING.

00:00:16.793 --> 00:00:22.232
THAT'S LEADING MANY TO ABANDON

00:00:20.363 --> 00:00:23.633
HOPE AND LEAVE.

00:00:22.365 --> 00:00:24.801
RICH TELLS US ABOUT IT TONIGHT

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:28.371
FROM THE STATE DEPARTMENT.

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:30.974
&gt;&gt; DESPERATE FOR FOOD AND

00:00:28.505 --> 00:00:33.409
MEDICINE, THOUSANDS FROM

00:00:31.107 --> 00:00:35.612
VENEZUELA CROSS INTO COLUMBIA.

00:00:33.543 --> 00:00:37.814
&gt;&gt; WE ARE STAFFERING.

00:00:35.745 --> 00:00:48.658
-- STARVING.

00:00:37.947 --> 00:00:51.227
WE ARE DIEING OF HUNGER.

00:00:48.792 --> 00:00:51.561
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE SLEEPING ON THE

00:00:51.361 --> 00:00:53.997
TREATS.

00:00:51.694 --> 00:00:54.397
&gt;&gt; THE BILLS ARE NOT WORTH

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:55.932
ANYTHING.

00:00:54.531 --> 00:00:59.169
JUST PAPER.

00:00:56.065 --> 00:01:03.807
&gt;&gt; INFLATION IN VENEZUELA WILL

00:00:59.302 --> 00:01:09.245
RISE 13,000% AND THE ECONOMY

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:11.247
SHRINKS 15%.

00:01:09.379 --> 00:01:17.053
MORE THAN 4 IN 10 IN VENEZUELA

00:01:11.381 --> 00:01:17.954
WANT TO LEAVE THE COUNTRY

00:01:17.187 --> 00:01:19.489
PERMANENTLY.

00:01:18.087 --> 00:01:21.057
VIOLENCE AND HUNGER HAVE

00:01:19.622 --> 00:01:22.926
OVERCOME THE COUNTRY.

00:01:21.191 --> 00:01:23.793
THE PRESIDENT IS STILL PURSUING

00:01:23.059 --> 00:01:27.297
REELECTION IN MAY.

00:01:23.927 --> 00:01:30.633
&gt;&gt; WE ARE UNDER PRESSURE BUT

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:31.034
VENEZUELA IS BASED ON

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:32.602
PRINCIPALS.

00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:37.640
&gt;&gt; THE UNITED STATES CALLED THAT

00:01:32.735 --> 00:01:39.042
MAY 20th ELECTION ILLEGITIMATE

00:01:37.774 --> 00:01:41.077
AND CONSIDERING SANCTIONS.

00:01:39.175 --> 00:01:46.115
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE SEEN THE REPEATED

00:01:41.211 --> 00:01:48.351
ELECTIONS WHERE THE REGIME

00:01:46.249 --> 00:01:49.052
PUSHED PEOPLE TO VOTE A CERTAIN

00:01:48.484 --> 00:01:51.554
PAY.

00:01:49.185 --> 00:01:54.924
OUR CONCERNS REMAIN ABOUT THE

00:01:51.688 --> 00:01:55.258
EROSION OF DEMOCRACY IN THAT

00:01:55.058 --> 00:01:59.495
COUNTRY.

00:01:55.391 --> 00:02:01.898
&gt;&gt; IT'S MORE DIFFICULT FOR

00:01:59.629 --> 00:02:03.266
VENEZUELA RESIDENTS TO LEAVE

00:02:02.031 --> 00:02:06.870
THEIR COUNTRY.

00:02:03.399 --> 00:02:08.638
&gt;&gt; I HOPE THEY DON'T DEPORT ME.

00:02:07.003 --> 00:02:09.472
I DON'T KNOW WHEN I WANT TO GO

00:02:08.771 --> 00:02:11.341
BACK TO VENEZUELA.

00:02:09.606 --> 00:02:14.677
I PLAN TO STAY HERE WORKING TO

00:02:11.474 --> 00:02:15.044
ACHIEVE A BETTER LIFE FOR MY

00:02:14.811 --> 00:02:17.180
CHILDREN.

